  <NAME>Mechanism of action of hDF-EVs on fibroblasts and keratinocytes [RNA-seq]</NAME>
  <TITLE>Mechanism of action of hDF-EVs on fibroblasts and keratinocytes [RNA-seq]</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>hDF-EVs miRNA array, hDFs and HaCaT cells were co-cultured with hDF-EVs for transcriptome sequencing Overall design: hDFs were maintained in extracellular vesicles (EV)-depleted medium for 72 h, after which conditioned supernatant was harvested for hDF-EVs isolation and miRNA profiling. hDFs and HaCaT cells were then co-cultured with purified exosomes for 3 days, followed by whole-transcriptome sequencing (RNA-seq) to assess cellular responses.</DESCRIPTION>
